  member .mdsformanc is ARRAY
  member .mdsformbra is ARRAY
  member .mdsformcab is ARRAY
  member .mdsformfix is ARRAY
  member .mdsformfra is ARRAY
  member .mdsformgen is ARRAY
  member .mdsformgui is ARRAY
  member .mdsformhva is ARRAY
  member .mdsformsli is ARRAY
  member .mdsformspr is ARRAY
  member .mdsformtru is ARRAY
  member .mdsformves is ARRAY
  member .mdshangiflisega is ARRAY
  member .mdshangifmds is ARRAY
  member .mdshangifpsl is ARRAY
  member .mdshangifcpl is ARRAY
  member .mdshangif is ARRAY
  member .mdslevchange is ARRAY
  member .mdsmaxhang is ARRAY
  member .mdsmaxpiva is ARRAY
  member .mdsminhang is ARRAY
  member .mdsoffset is ARRAY
  member .mdsorinot is ARRAY
  member .mdsoriwrt is ARRAY
  member .mdspackdi is ARRAY
  member .mdspackmo is ARRAY
  member .mdspivwarn is ARRAY
  member .mdsspecfla is ARRAY
  member .mdsspecon is ARRAY
  member .mdsspecpre is ARRAY
  member .mdssuppcl is ARRAY
  member .mdssuppms is ARRAY
  member .mdssuppov is ARRAY
  member .mdstraniso is ARRAY
  member .mdstranpref is ARRAY
  member .mdstruncode is ARRAY
